@startuml
title RNF10 — Notificações via Chrome (Web Push) · Máquina de estados: PushSubscription.status
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "Pedindo permissão" as Pedindo
Pedindo : gesto do usuário
state "Negada" as Negada
Negada : só in-app
state "ACTIVE" as ACTIVE
ACTIVE : endpoint registrado
state "FAILING" as FAILING
FAILING : 5xx/429 · retry com backoff
state "REVOKED" as REVOKED
REVOKED : 404/410 ou revogada pelo usuário
[*] --> Pedindo
Pedindo --> ACTIVE : granted + POST ok
Pedindo --> Negada : denied
ACTIVE --> FAILING : falha transitória
FAILING --> ACTIVE : entrega ok
FAILING --> REVOKED : 3 falhas
ACTIVE --> REVOKED : 404/410 ou DELETE
REVOKED --> [*]
Negada --> [*]
@enduml
